#~ "Alle Hero- und Detailtext- sowie Schriftanpassungen gehen verloren. Die Bookshelf-UI-Schrift und das Regalmenü bleiben unverändert."

#~ msgid "Rows and columns set how much of the screen the shelf takes; the hero area above fills whatever is left. List and spine shelves use that same space with their own row counts, so covers are shown here while you adjust it."
